				<wikidot:authorName>Logan Armstrong</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1720957</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: justify;"> <p>The symbol of Medicine is <em>not</em> the <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caduceus">caduceus</a>. The caduceus is the staff carried by Hermes, and is used as a modern symbol of commerce, while being commonly mistaken for the symbol of medicine. The symbol of Medicine is the <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rod_of_Asclepius">Rod of Asclepius</a>.</p> <p>That given, even though it's immensely silly, i found it silly and weird enough to get me to upvote it really neutrally, because even though that it's a masturbating universe who shapes objects like genitalia, it's well written. Also, M83 is one of my favorite galaxies to look at, so, yeah. Upvote. Good job.</p> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
